WEBVTT

00:09:59.454 --> 00:10:02.746
and deconstructing the house and allowing
everybody to rebuild it?

00:10:03.162 --> 00:10:05.412
And if we're not, then I
have to make changes.

00:10:05.662 --> 00:10:10.621
And I think that's probably the biggest
thing is trying to build a mirror

00:10:10.621 --> 00:10:16.037
for myself that actually presents an
image of me as I am and not as

00:10:16.037 --> 00:10:17.954
I want to imagine myself.

00:10:18.621 --> 00:10:20.496
If that makes sense, that
totally makes sense.

00:10:20.621 --> 00:10:22.579
So for everyone listening
who may not know,

00:10:22.954 --> 00:10:26.371
last year the Academy issued some new
rules for films to be considered for

00:10:26.371 --> 00:10:29.954
an Oscar. The rules had minimum
requirements for diversity and inclusion,